               <dimensions unit="cm" xml:id="dimensions_1c0921c3">35 x 28</dimensions>
               <physMedium xml:id="physMedium_f9704a5b">Bound in brownish cardboard cover Handwritten label pasted on front cover inscribed: "Den sørgende Jødinde". Written in brown ink. Paper: 16 staves. Title above the first stave: "'Den sørgende Jødinde' / H:C: Andersens Digt 'Ahasverus'." The first bifolio which comprises stanza 1 on pp. 1-3 is end-dated "I:P:E: Hartmann. / d: 20. febr: 44". The 5 bars on p. 4 have been cancelled. Then Hartmann has started a fresh on three new bifolios comprising stanza 2 probably written in 1875, since the score is end-dated "24/4 75." The last three pages are blank. In the later part of the score bar lines have been added in blue crayon.</physMedium>
            </physDesc>
